      "mechanic_id": "DATA_FIELDS",
      "bucket": "combat",
      "text": "`CpuCore` inherits from `CpuRegisters`, so all register properties (AX, BX, CS, IP, CarryFlag, etc.) are directly accessible as `this.AX`, `Registers.AX`, etc. throughout the opcode handlers. This flat inheritance was chosen for performance \u2014 it avoids indirection in the hottest code path."
